WEBVTT

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:39.350
Yumi...

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.430
Fubuki-san...

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.140
Asuka...

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.370
We won't let you hurt Asuka-chan!

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.800
It doesn't matter how
many of you there are.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:18.090
I will destroy all of the shinobi,
 for Fubuki's sake.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:20.510
Even if it costs me my life!

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.510
Tell me...

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:27.390
Why are you willing
to risk your life for her?

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.370
Asuka?

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:32.400
Fubuki's mother saved my life.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.010
Is that so strange to you?

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:40.160
That I'd risk my life for such a reason?

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.700
No.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.590
It's not strange at all.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.700
I know exactly how you feel.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.850
I see.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:52.180
But if you're going
to destroy the shinobi...

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:54.940
You're going to seal me away?

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.980
Do you think you can?

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.050
I do!

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.550
Because I'll risk my life, too!

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:10.770
Everyone,

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.440
give me your power!

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.070
Shinobi transformation!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:38.050
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:38.800
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:39.510
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:39.840
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.010
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.010
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:54.720
Hey,

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.220
is this really the right way?

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:56.940
Yeah.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.170
I saw Yumi-chin flying off this way.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.890
She'll be okay, right?

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.670
Yumi-chan won't lose, right?

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.520
That way!

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.510
Shinobi transformation!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.600
Now it's my turn to attack!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.360
Now, Asuka!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:47.470
Right!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.510
Super Secret Ninja Art!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.980
Fuma Korin!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.080
We did it!

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.940
Now...

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.230
It's over.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.240
<i>Rasetsu...</i>

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.360
Be careful.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:11.200
They'll use Fuma Korin.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.980
I know I'm fighting shinobi,

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.490
so I'm ready for it.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:18.500
But do you really think I will be sealed?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.050
Please...

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.500
Lend me your strength
until the last moment.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.850
Power...

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.880
I want more power!

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:32.710
I want power, even if I have
to give up everything else!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.840
Fubuki,

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.150
this is goodbye.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.410
What?

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:47.400
No!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:57.410
So you've lost your mind
and turned into a beast?

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.170
This is bad!

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.170
If something like that
gets out into the city...

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.540
We have to stop it here!

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.690
<i>Why do I remember?</i>

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:37.700
Hang in there, Asuka.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:41.840
You can barely stand up yourself,
Homura-chan.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.440
Don't be stupid.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.620
I'm just getting started.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.840
So are you. Right, Asuka?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.040
Yeah.

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.090
But Fuma Korin didn't work on her.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:55.980
What do we do?

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.160
It didn't work with your power alone.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:58.850
But...

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.530
What if we do it together?

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:03.730
I'll seal her, too!

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:06.860
Homura-chan, you can't
use Fuma Korin, can you?

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:09.370
I've seen you do it a bunch of times.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.860
So I know how to do it!

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:13.940
You're going to try it here,
without practicing first?

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:17.850
There's nothing you can do that I can't!

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:20.040
But you might die!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.620
Oh, I'm not worried about that.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:23.530
Why?

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:24.880
You know why.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.880
I won't die.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:30.880
I'll never die...

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.300
...until I master the path of the shinobi!

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.510
Let's go, Homura-chan!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.010
Right, Asuka!

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.610
Hien Ranbu!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.450
Asuka, now!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.770
Homura-chan, let's do it!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.650
Super Secret Ninja Art:

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.820
Fuma Korin!

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.370
What do you want now,

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.830
after all's said and done?

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:47.840
We came to save someone.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.060
Then I'm afraid you're too late.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:55.070
Yumi just sank to the bottom of the lake.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.600
It's not Yumi-senpai that
needs saving right now.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.470
The one we want to save, Fubuki-sama,

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.480
is you.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.900
Save me?

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.390
Don't make me laugh.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.990
No...

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:14.990
We're serious.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:24.450
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:24.450
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:35.530
How are you going to save
me if you just stand there?

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:40.390
What are you doing?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:45.410
This is what we learned
from Yumi-senpai...

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:48.010
The justice that Kurokage-sama found.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.020
Warmth.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.610
Shut up!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.610
Who was it that stole
that warmth from me?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.610
It was the shinobi!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.660
But the warmth is here now.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.240
Fubuki-sama, you have us!

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.530
I have the blood of a youma!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:11.040
Human warmth can't reach me!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.670
Let go!

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.010
If you don't, you'll die!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.010
We won't!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.720
We refuse!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.760
Never!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.270
You...

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.020
You're too late.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.020
Yumi is dead.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.730
Do you intend not to fight?

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:52.540
We do.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.660
There's no point in begging
for your life, you know.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:58.800
We're not the ones
who'll be fighting you.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.020
Yup,

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:02.680
in the end, it's always Yumi-chin.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:05.920
Weren't you listening to me?

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.810
Yumi is dead.

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:18.190
No...

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:30.060
No...

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.710
We can't seal her.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.850
This is pathetic.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:36.850
Miyabi-chan?

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.890
My goal is to become
the ultimate shinobi!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.350
Hey, wait!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:52.150
I've got a long way to go, I guess.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.730
I forgot what I'd learned
when I lost my mother.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.420
What?

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.360
Miyabi-chan?

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.060
When you fight for revenge,

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:05.030
you cannot attain true strength!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:07.870
Fuma Korin!

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:27.900
I have no regrets.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.840
In the end,

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:33.720
I fought for Fubuki.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.350
I'm sorry.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.280
I...

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.030
<i>Fubuki!</i>

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:53.290
I see.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.530
Rasetsu...

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.050
Yumi!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.440
Here I go!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.550
Yumi, why are you...

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:14.230
I'll keep standing up as
many times as it takes,

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.060
so that you understand my strength!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.060
I... No,

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.400
you and I...

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:25.570
will work together to put an end
to the war between shinobi and youma!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:29.320
Not as an unyielding shield,

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:32.830
but as a sword filled
with human warmth.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.870
That is my justice...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.850
The justice of the moon!

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.780
Well done, Kagura.

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.260
I exist to annihilate the youma.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.500
And for all eternity, that's all I will be.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.760
Yes, I understand.

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:36.960
I'll tell everyone.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:38.740
Haruka-sama?

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.370
Who are you talking to?

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.250
Suzune-sensei.

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.610
They're done at the Kikai Dome, she says.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.170
Really?

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.470
Yes, everyone's safe.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.990
Even Kiriya-sensei?

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:52.450
Of course!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.250
Hanzou-sama and Sayuri-sama
sealed the youma.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.240
You dropped this.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.860
Okay, let's go home!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.180
Yeah!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.840
Let's all go home.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:49.880
I want to take a bath.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.220
That sounds nice.

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:06.980
Minori,

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.220
put some sweets up here.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:10.090
Okay!

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.400
Leave it to me!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.030
I'll help too, Minori-chan.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:18.250
Asuka-san and Yumi-san
are on their way here.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.390
Um...

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:25.490
Do I really have to wear this?

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:26.360
Yes.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.620
Every Christmas needs a reindeer.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:31.090
That's a squid, Yagyu-chin.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:41.250
Wow.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.140
Miyabi-san...

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:46.030
Miyabi, the sweat dripping
off your body is so beautiful.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:47.000
Wait,

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.210
why are we training on Christmas Day?

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.160
Ryobi-chan,

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.730
just think of it as a new type of kink,

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:57.150
and your whole body will go jingle bells!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:59.160
See? Jin-jin,

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.160
Gle-gle!

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:03.660
Bell! Bell!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.490
That doesn't even make sense,
you stupid dog!

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.440
<i>There's no time to rest.</i>

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.680
<i>I will become the ultimate shinobi!</i>

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:13.920
Take a look!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.890
I just finished my giant snowman!

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.400
It was a lot of work.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.940
It's missing something, though.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.100
Let's make it something special!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.440
It's Christmas, after all!

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:28.430
Now it's okay.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:29.690
"Okay"?

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.510
What's okay?

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.220
What's going on?

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:39.720
Let them have their fun.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.820
It's Christmas!

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.440
I can't believe we're
working on Christmas.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:50.200
We were fighting for so long,
we didn't get any shifts.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:55.090
But working today won't
get us a turkey and a cake.

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.410
That's right.

00:17:56.410 --> 00:18:00.340
I'll have to make a bean
sprout Christmas cake!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.210
Yomi, there's no need to worry.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.140
The manager just told me...

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.800
If we work hard today,

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:10.600
he'll give us the leftover Christmas
cakes and turkeys for free!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:14.350
Now let's get to work!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.100
With the five us together,

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:17.530
there's nothing we can't do!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.610
Right!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.210
Asuka-san,

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.120
how are you feeling?

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.770
I'm just fine now.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.420
The marks on my body disappeared.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.370
And I'm still training with everybody.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.820
You still shouldn't
push yourself too hard.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:38.480
I'm fine.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:41.640
Christmas Eve comes
but once a year, you know!

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.640
We worked so hard to enjoy it.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.770
When it's time to have fun...

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.700
...we've gotta have a lot of fun!

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:48.810
Right?

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.030
Fubuki-san...

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:05.050
I won't kill the youma.

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:06.130
As a shinobi,

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.800
I'll risk my life to seal them.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.220
No matter what anybody tells me,

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:11.700
that will never change.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.540
I feel the same way.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:20.040
If everything in this world
has its counterpart...

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:23.040
Then shinobi and youma
are a pair as well.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:28.100
Perhaps the time will come
when we must fight again.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.120
Take it.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.070
But...

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:45.570
I don't need it anymore.

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:49.580
All right.

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:51.550
Farewell.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:55.230
I will try to find my place
in the human world.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:58.590
Hey!

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:04.340
I never got a chance to fight you.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.600
So let's continue the Shinobi Masters!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.610
Why are you following me?

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:31.620
Aren't you lonely by yourself?

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.140
I'm not alone.

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:36.400
Somewhere, in another place,

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:38.630
my mother and Rasetsu are with me.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:40.660
And we're here, too.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:41.260
Yes.

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.510
You're right.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.190
Here.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.520
I want you to have the sword,

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:00.270
and I will have the shield.

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:01.550
Okay.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.280
Thanks!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:07.280
Hey, Yumi-chan,

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.280
I've never really asked, but...

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.160
What is it?

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:15.410
What kind of shinobi do you want to be?

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:16.660
What kind of shinobi?

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:23.680
Hmm...

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:29.650
I want to be a shinobi
that's like this snow.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.690
No matter how white the snow is,

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:37.310
when it touches the ground, it melts
 into the dirt and disappears.

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:40.700
But even so...

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.820
That's still who I want to be.

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.160
See?

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:47.830
The white disappeared.

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.660
You're right.

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:55.330
<i>Where there is light, there is shadow.</i>

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:59.340
<i>This is the story of young shinobi girls...</i>

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.120
<i>...who live in the shadows.</i>
